Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?feat:=20beta.9=20=E2=80=94=20updater-aware=20ba?=
 =?UTF-8?q?nner,=20Study=20section=20delete?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Update banner no longer races the silent auto-updater: it now narrates it
  (downloading in background → Restart now via nemesis:updater:status/install
  IPC); the manual download link only remains when the updater is unavailable
  or errored (beta.8: users hand-installed while the download was in flight).
- Study: sections can be deleted (trash icon on the header + confirm dialog);
  decks inside are kept and drop back to the ungrouped list. deleteSection in
  model.ts, case-insensitive, tested.
